Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Process developer reports, incidents, and issue histories to identify recurring friction. Separate specific observed costs from broad complaints, deduplicate repeated descriptions of one event, and preserve minority workflows that may face severe but infrequent problems.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
